"412\" y2=\"226.20607661822987\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"58.95055555555555,371.8888888888889 93.0706976744186,356.6046511627907 177.3216,314.05333333333334 276.9136000000001,207.28 362.5761538461539,139.33333333333334 410.17541850220266,45.25991189427316\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 3% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 216 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.95055555555555\" cy=\"371.8888888888889\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 10%&amp;#10;It rained 7% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 86 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"93.0706976744186\" cy=\"356.6046511627907\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 34%&amp;#10;It rained 19% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"177.3216\" cy=\"314.05333333333334\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 62%&amp;#10;It rained 48% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"276.9136000000001\" cy=\"207.28\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 86%&amp;#10;It rained 67% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 78 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"362.5761538461539\" cy=\"139.33333333333334\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 93% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 227 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"410.17541850220266\" cy=\"45.25991189427316\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(43%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Rotterdam the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>spring</b> (0.61) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.44).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>39%</td><td class='num'>0.441</td><td class='num'>15.8%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>53%</td><td class='num'>0.526</td><td class='num'>4.6%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>50%</td><td class='num'>0.590</td><td class='num'>5.1%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>218</td><td class='num'>32%</td><td class='num'>0.607</td><td class='num'>6.3%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":51.9225,"lon":4.47917,"n":757,"n_cities":134,"name":"Rotterdam","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.04,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.002685185185185185,"n":216,"obs":0.027777777777777776,"sig":true},{"hi":0.21,"lo":0.04,"mean":0.09906976744186045,"n":86,"obs":0.06976744186046512,"sig":false},{"hi":0.49,"lo":0.21,"mean":0.3370666666666667,"n":75,"obs"